{
    "title": "inKind",
    "description": "The inKind App takes the difficulty out of tracking credit spending and ensures that you get VIP treatment at your favorite local business. Within the app, you can check, redeem, and share credit on your VIP House Accounts bought from one of inKind's partner restaurants, bars, and other businesses.\r\n\r\nCHECK CREDIT BALANCE\r\nSee how much credit you have to use in your favorite business. Will it be a champagne popping night or will the happy hour menu be your new best friend?\r\n\r\nREDEEM CREDIT\r\nLeave your wallet at home and complete all your credit transactions on the inKind App. Your credit card can be linked to allow you to tip your server/bartender when they do an awesome job looking after you.\r\n\r\nSHARE CREDIT\r\nTreat your friends, family or a hard-working employee by sharing some of your credit with them. They will receive an email notification and can head straight into your business and enjoy the credit you have given them.\r\n\r\nEXPLORE RESTAURANTS AROUND YOU\r\nUse the map to browse venues in your area, or in cities you're traveling too across the country.\r\n\r\nGIVE FEEDBACK\r\nSometimes a restaurant tries something new and misses the mark, or hires someone that maybe isn\u2019t the best fit. Provide private feedback that will help them get better, without destroying their Yelp rating.\r\n\r\nLearn more at inKind.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The inKind App takes the difficulty out of tracking credit spending and ensures that you get VIP treatment at your favorite local business. Within the app, you can check, redeem, and share credit on your VIP House Accounts bought from one of inKind&#39;s partner restaurants, bars, and other businesses.<br><br>CHECK CREDIT BALANCE<br>See how much credit you have to use in your favorite business. Will it be a champagne popping night or will the happy hour menu be your new best friend?<br><br>REDEEM CREDIT<br>Leave your wallet at home and complete all your credit transactions on the inKind App. Your credit card can be linked to allow you to tip your server/bartender when they do an awesome job looking after you.<br><br>SHARE CREDIT<br>Treat your friends, family or a hard-working employee by sharing some of your credit with them. They will receive an email notification and can head straight into your business and enjoy the credit you have given them.<br><br>EXPLORE RESTAURANTS AROUND YOU<br>Use the map to browse venues in your area, or in cities you&#39;re traveling too across the country.<br><br>GIVE FEEDBACK<br>Sometimes a restaurant tries something new and misses the mark, or hires someone that maybe isn\u2019t the best fit. Provide private feedback that will help them get better, without destroying their Yelp rating.<br><br>Learn more at inKind.com.",
